# Yosys generic synthesis recipe (Design Compiler stand-in).
# Invoked via run_synth.sh with: yosys -s <generated script> or -p string.
# No liberty / techmap to a foundry library — generic cells only.
#
# Typical sequence (documented):
#   read_verilog -sv <rtl>
#   hierarchy -top <mod>
#   proc; opt; fsm; memory; opt
#   synth -top <mod>
#   abc   # if available as yosys pass (bundled)
#   stat
#   write_verilog out/synth/<mod>_netlist.v   # optional
